# INVWINSZ.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, on the one empty
# location of TEST/KEYS/LOCONE.REQ: what the pane beside the tree shows
# after the data change under it.  Office backed up, then renamed
# Bureau, its contents counted under that name; from the item list a
# restore gives it its old name back, which the tree, opened again on
# it, and its contents' count show.  Office deleted, the tree is empty
# and its pane cleared; a second restore brings it back with the key it
# had, and its contents load again and take the focus by TAB.  The end
# by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINSZ.SNP is its snapshot;
# TEST/splitchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-L B
K ALT-A B
T .
K ENTER
S BACKEDUP
K ENTER CTRL-E
T Bureau
K ENTER TAB
S RENAMED
K ESC ESC
K ALT-A R
T .
K ENTER Y
S RESTORED
K ENTER ALT-L B TAB
S REOPENED
K ESC DEL Y
S EMPTY
K ALT-A R
T .
K ENTER Y ENTER
S AGAIN
K TAB
S PANE
K ALT-F X
